80\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597670/extras/88aca665ab4cb1fa4bd762f374f827f7.webm?t=1773568780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597670/extras/88aca665ab4cb1fa4bd762f374f827f7.mp4?t=1773568780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the bubbles in the tub</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massage her soft fur</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Treat her to tasty snacks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597670/extras/75b30d5cc4177db077045ebf1cb11434.poster.avif?t=1773568780\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597670/extras/75b30d5cc4177db077045ebf1cb11434.webm?t=1773568780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597670/extras/75b30d5cc4177db077045ebf1cb11434.mp4?t=1773568780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Capybara \u2013 the Ultimate Internet Star</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t miss your chance to go viral! Stream live from the hot bath and win over your viewers:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ASMR with juicy berries and tropical drinks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Graceful swimming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fashion outfit showcases</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597670/extras/efb62fdc44310b992a3ddadec254cbd2.poster.avif?t=1773568780\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.ste